        "note": "Bun.serve now passed reusePort:false explicitly (server.ts) — Bun was binding SO_REUSEPORT-style on Linux despite its own docs claiming that default, reproduced live before the fix (two instances both bound port 4996/4997 silently, requests round-robined). Confirmed live after the fix: second instance exits 1 with 'port N is already in use...'. New tests/acceptance/web-port-in-use.test.ts spawns two real slop web processes and asserts the second fails fast while the first keeps serving. Full verification suite green.",
